      "title": "Inception whose d differs from its digest-type i",
      "description": "A signed inception whose prefix i is a Blake3-256 digest but not the inception's own SAID, while d is the SAID computed over the event. Line 1381 says d must then equal i, so the inception is invalid and a validator must not accept it.",
